; FileCheck spec for enum_match.logos.
;
; Asserts the enum match lowers to a chain of integer compares against the
; discriminant value (0/1/2 for Red/Green/Blue). Locks codegen contract:
; bare-tag enum match uses i32 discriminant + direct icmp, not a function
; table or dispatch indirection.

; CHECK-LABEL: define i32 @main()
; CHECK: store i32 1, ptr
; CHECK-DAG: icmp eq i32 {{.*}}, 0
; CHECK-DAG: icmp eq i32 {{.*}}, 1
; CHECK-DAG: icmp eq i32 {{.*}}, 2
; CHECK: ret i32

; CHECK-NOT: call i32 @Color__
